OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire risk remains after
OL,4,Adevastating summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters in Jersey, Devon and
OL,7,FCornwall have warned the risk of
OL,8,Fwildfires remains high after one of the
OL,9,Fbusiest summers in recent years.
OL,11,FJersey crews attended 24 wildfires
OL,12,Fbetween June and August, while Devon
OL,13,FFire and Rescue Service teams tackled
OL,14,Fmore than 1,000 open-land fires.
OL,16,FIn Cornwall, firefighters from
OL,17,FWadebridge Community Fire Station were
OL,18,Fmobilised to 95 incidents in 92 days
OL,19,Fsince the beginning of June.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
