OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire risk remains after
OL,4,Adevastating summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Fire and Rescue Service said,
OL,7,Fdespite recent rainfall, "this summer's
OL,8,Frecord-breaking heat has left some
OL,9,Fareas vulnerable and the risk of
OL,10,Fwildfire remains very real".
